  "worked_solution": "The general solution to our equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x+{75}^{\u2218} & ={135}^{\u2218}+n\\cdot {180}^{\u2218}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSolving the above equation for $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x & ={135}^{\u2218}-{75}^{\u2218}+n\\cdot {180}^{\u2218} \\\\ 5x & ={60}^{\u2218}+n\\cdot {180}^{\u2218} \\\\ x & ={12}^{\u2218}+n\\cdot {36}^{\u2218}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that $a=12.$",
